WEBVTT

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.080
Hold on, Alto!

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.040
I cannot let you pass.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.960
You will engage with me for the time being.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.920
How very annoying.

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:51.670
Vermeil!

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.130
Incredible, truly incredible!

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:23.630
THIS is what all my research was for!

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.580
Black or white? Tangled up, they turn gray

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:57.880
Everything always seems so ambiguous

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:03.790
I walk by your side as you smile, helpless

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:07.170
Admiration clear as day

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:10.460
Shining out across the endless distance

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:16.210
Cast a spell on this pitiful situation with an Abracada-Boo

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:22.420
There's a loneliness hidden beneath the darkness in your eyes

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:29.210
I wish I could embrace it with a gentle song

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:33.750
Even the whole world starts to shout it's all a lie,

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.670
As long as you are as you are

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:42.880
I'll sweep through with a glimmering wind and scream out the truth

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.460
Even if the whole world yells out that it's a sin,

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:49.250
Even if I'm all on my own

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:52.330
I want to keep learning to understand you

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:57.830
I'm on your side, I'll protect you

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:06.750
<b>WISH</b>

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:09.500
Vermeil...

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.330
Wh-what is that?

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:16.250
Professor!

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.750
Professor Obsidian! What's going on?

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:24.130
Oh, excellent timing!

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:28.170
P-Professor...?

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:34.670
Come, look at this. Isn't is absolutely incredible?

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:36.920
Behold!

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.880
She's kneeling before me! A demon of her power!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:55.710
Professor, what is going on?

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:59.960
Hm? What? You still haven't pieced it together?

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:03.500
And here I thought you were a brilliant student.

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.540
This was no easy task.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:08.330
I had to establish a magical means of causing madness,

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:11.540
but condensing it into a liquid form
was back-breaking labor.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:12.880
It was custom-made, after all.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:24.500
Injecting it causes their powers to run amok.
And it works on true demons, as you can see.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:29.080
Finding the right guinea pigs to test it was difficult.

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:32.000
I had to use five in total.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.580
But they served their purpose well.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:40.170
Now, my research has led me to this incredible success!

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:45.290
Wh-what does all of that mean?

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:50.080
You still don't understand?

00:04:55.380 --> 00:05:01.210
I'm the man behind everything, Alto Goldfield.

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.710
Everything...?

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:10.290
That's right. EVERYTHING.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:22.460
Behold, the greatest calamity known to man!
Who wouldn't want it in the palm of their hand?!

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:47.880
Yes! Even YOU are struck with awe and wonder!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:54.330
But fret not! You will find I am a far more
suitable master for her than you ever were!

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:13.210
VERMEIL, NO!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:37.880
Alto?

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:46.210
I felt as if I were adrift in deep water.

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:53.000
Dark, cold, nothingness...

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:58.880
Though it was something I so desired...

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:31.420
Yes, that's right...

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:41.420
I...

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.460
I...

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:53.580
I...

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:21.250
She's growing even more vicious...

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:23.920
This can't be!

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:39.000
You can't.

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:46.920
Vermeil.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.080
Alto...

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:03.830
Alto...

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:07.460
Why?

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:13.540
Why? I don't know...

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:17.080
I moved without really thinking.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.250
Besides...

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:23.790
...I'm...

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:29.000
...your master, Vermeil.

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:40.420
Alto, I... I...

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:45.750
It's all right.

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:54.960
I'm right here. Everything is all right.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:05.710
Alto?

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:12.540
No... Is he dead?

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:14.380
I've got him.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.080
Alto...

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:25.500
I won't let you die.

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:30.790
You're the one person I'll never let go.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.920
Golden mana...

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:13.380
It can't be!

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.210
Even death is no match for them...

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:21.750
Is that what a real demon can do?

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:25.290
A real demon... A real demon... A real demon!

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:27.880
A real demon, a real one...

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:31.540
What the hell?! Why did this happen?!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:36.380
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it all to Hell!

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:38.210
Wh-what's that?

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.960
I won't be fooled!

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:44.420
"Real" demons don't mean shit!

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:06.580
Don't take me for a fool!

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:10.960
I'd steeled myself for this long before!

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:18.210
Behold! This is my creation, the demon hybrid!

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:23.080
The ultimate demon,
fed upon hundreds of low-level demons!

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:27.290
And with your rampage ended, I can crush you easily!

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.880
This is my research!

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.250
Feast your eyes upon me, plebians!

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.580
This is my true power!

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:40.290
I'd planned on keeping you as my pet, but no more!

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:48.500
I'll slice you, crush you, and assimilate you into my being!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:12:59.210
Huh?

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:05.130
N-no! How?! With one strike?!

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:14.750
Damn it! Damn it all to Hell!

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.790
Damn it! Damn everything!

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:20.920
Damn it all!

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:24.000
I'll make my escape into the sky!

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:29.460
What?!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.580
N-no!

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:45.000
D-don't kill me!

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:27.920
I won't kill you.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:31.330
Not after Alto saved your precious life.

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:46.920
Huh? I...

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.920
Alto!

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:52.670
L-Lilia?!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:55.580
You're alive, you're alive!

00:14:56.000 --> 00:15:01.130
I thought you'd never wake up again!

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.630
Please, calm down, Lilia...

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.790
The wound's healed up...

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:17.790
Vermeil?

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:28.170
One day, we'll meet again.

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:42.500
There you are.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.880
How are your injuries?

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:50.630
Oh! I was shocked, they're mostly fine.
Even the doctor was stunned.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:52.250
I see.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.080
Good, then.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:01.130
Um... Vermeil, when I-

00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:06.540
I pierced your heart with my attack.

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:08.540
You were dead.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:12.040
S-so you healed me, Vermeil?

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:18.250
Not quite.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:28.920
Your heart only beats because my mana
has been knit together as one with you.

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:39.580
I'm sorry.

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:41.670
Huh?

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:44.920
Why are you apologizing, Vermeil?

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:48.080
I don't care how you did it, you saved my life!

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:51.880
And my momentary death wasn't your fault!

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:54.960
Look, I'm walking around, right as rain!

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:55.580
You're not.

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:56.420
Huh?

00:16:57.460 --> 00:17:00.580
You are, but you aren't.

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:05.790
The heart beating in your chest is my heart.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:10.750
The heart of a true demon.

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:15.750
This means if I die, you die, too.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:24.630
H-hold on, does that mean-

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:31.040
Yes. If you die, then I die, too.

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:34.790
Why did you do that?!

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:41.290
I mean, you're a demon, Vermeil!
You should live forever! Centuries, millennia!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:49.750
And I'll die like every other human...

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.080
I'm sorry.

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:02.880
That was all Vermeil had to say.

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:12.670
I heard the student council president
fought against a co-conspirator,

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:14.710
but we haven't any clues about them...

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:19.170
Professor Obsidian was hauled away
by the Ortigia City Guard.

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:27.170
Though many mysteries still hung in the air,
the incident was, for the moment, resolved.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:35.330
Ow!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.630
Dammit, what the hell's going on...?

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:55.460
The students in comas all woke up and were feeling fine.

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:03.330
Alto, it's time.

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:06.250
Oh, I didn't realize it was this late.

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:12.540
A few things have changed since then.

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:17.710
Now my heart needs Vermeil's mana to function.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:23.170
How are you feeling? Anything feel off?

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:25.580
Oh, no, I feel fine.

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:31.750
And Vermeil stopped talking to me.

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:33.710
Hey, Vermeil!

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:38.380
Hm? What is it? Is there something
you wish to tell me after all?

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:41.000
Why are you acting so cold?!

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:45.000
"Why?" You know why.

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:48.830
I'm a monster they call a scourge, a living disaster.

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:53.170
I shouldn't be around a being like you.

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:56.170
Are you not afraid of me?

00:19:57.080 --> 00:20:03.790
You saw how terrifying my true form is.
I'm an ugly, vile monster.

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.960
Th-th-that's not true!

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:10.460
Don't worry, I'll accept responsibility
for turning you into this.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:16.880
I'll return the mana you give me
into demon mana to feed your heart.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:24.960
It may take decades for the heart to properly take hold,
but once it does, my role in your life will be over.

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:26.080
Huh?

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:29.880
Did you not just hear me? I shouldn't be around you.

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:33.080
I'll go hide away in another book.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:37.330
That'll be better for you, too.

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:38.580
Vermeil...

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:41.670
...you're making me angry.

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:47.710
You don't get it, do you?
We can't live this "normal" life together anymore!

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:03.000
Wh-what are you doing?!

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:08.920
He didn't take any mana...

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.250
Why would I...?

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.290
Why would I be scared of you?!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.040
But I...

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:27.500
No "ifs," "ands," or "buts" about it!

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:30.250
You are my familiar, Vermeil!

00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:34.830
I need you by my side, now and always!

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:38.250
V-very well.

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.380
S-So you get it, then!

00:21:53.750 --> 00:22:01.080
A-anyway, I think you should only
k-kiss someone you're in love with!

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:22.580
Does it get easier with time for the immortal?

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:33.290
If I was born normal, if I become normal, can I stay close?

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:38.710
With the children, we link our arms

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:43.920
Make a circle and sing a song

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:50.670
Knowing there was no chair for me all along

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:55.960
You locked me into the dark, I'm your preserved flower

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:59.630
The world is too slow to understand

00:22:59.630 --> 00:23:03.210
Not all blossoms spark, And spikes may be sharp

00:23:03.330 --> 00:23:07.750
They only want to see the beautiful parts

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:11.130
Sitting in a shower of scarlet rain

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:15.460
It all used to be ours, I'm counting the hours

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:18.920
Hours that stood between us like a river

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:20.920
Once I crawled through the water

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:26.460
All I ever knew have become distant past
